    },
    {
      "id": "work_quotes-003",
      "category": "work_quotes",
      "text": "别跟我画职业大饼，我的规划是永久下班。",
      "tags": [
        "用户素材"
      ],
      "audience": "general",
      "enabled_by_default": true
    },
    {
      "id": "work_quotes-004",
      "category": "work_quotes",
      "text": "间歇性热血满满，持续性混吃躺平。",
      "tags": [
        "用户素材"
      ],
      "audience": "general",
      "enabled_by_default": true
    },
    {
      "id": "work_quotes-005",
      "category": "work_quotes",
      "text": "上班最大的收获就是——下班了。",
      "tags": [
        "用户素材"
      ],
      "audience": "general",
      "enabled_by_default": true
    },
    {
      "id": "work_quotes-006",
      "category": "work_quotes",
      "text": "我的工资构成：精神损失费、劳动所得费、忍气吞声费、熬夜加班费，以及算了不计较费。",
      "tags": [
        "用户素材"
      ],
      "audience": "general",
      "enabled_by_default": true
    },
    {
      "id": "work_quotes-007",
      "category": "work_quotes",
      "text": "上班就像旧时代的婚姻，明明不幸福，还得长相厮守。",
      "tags": [
        "用户素材"
      ],
      "audience": "general",
      "enabled_by_default": true
    },
