    {
      "id": "pua-001",
      "category": "pua",
      "text": "离开这个平台，你什么都不是。",
      "tags": [
        "用户素材"
      ],
      "audience": "optional",
      "enabled_by_default": false
    },
    {
      "id": "pua-002",
      "category": "pua",
      "text": "你的能力也就这样了，出去根本拿不到现在的薪水。",
      "tags": [
        "用户素材"
      ],
      "audience": "optional",
      "enabled_by_default": false
    },
    {
      "id": "pua-003",
      "category": "pua",
      "text": "你要反思一下，为什么别人都能完成，就你不行？",
      "tags": [
        "用户素材"
      ],
      "audience": "optional",
      "enabled_by_default": false
    },
    {
      "id": "pua-004",
      "category": "pua",
      "text": "我觉得你最近心态出了问题，需要好好调整。",
      "tags": [
        "用户素材"
      ],
      "audience": "optional",
      "enabled_by_default": false
    },
    {
      "id": "pua-005",
      "category": "pua",
      "text": "你性格太内向了，根本不适合干这行，也就我能容忍你。",
      "tags": [
        "用户素材"
      ],
      "audience": "optional",
      "enabled_by_default": false
    },
    {
      "id": "pua-006",
      "category": "pua",
      "text": "年轻人不要只盯着钱，要看重成长机会。",
      "tags": [
        "用户素材"
      ],
      "audience": "optional",
      "enabled_by_default": false
    },
    {
      "id": "pua-007",
      "category": "pua",
      "text": "这个项目做好了，我帮你跟上面申请升职加薪。",
      "tags": [
        "用户素材"
      ],
      "audience": "optional",
      "enabled_by_default": false
    },
    {
      "id": "pua-008",
      "category": "pua",
      "text": "现在苦一点，等公司上市了，你们都是元老。",
      "tags": [
        "用户素材"
      ],
      "audience": "optional",
      "enabled_by_default": false
    },
    {
      "id": "pua-009",
      "category": "pua",
      "text": "把公司当家，公司不会亏待家人的。",
      "tags": [
        "用户素材"
      ],
      "audience": "optional",
      "enabled_by_default": false
    },
    {
      "id": "pua-010",
      "category": "pua",
      "text": "别计较眼前得失，我在你这个年纪时，加班比你还狠。",
      "tags": [
        "用户素材"
      ],
      "audience": "optional",
      "enabled_by_default": false
    },
    {
      "id": "pua-011",
      "category": "pua",
      "text": "公司现在这么难还给你发工资。",
      "tags": [
        "用户素材"
      ],
      "audience": "optional",
      "enabled_by_default": false
    },
    {
      "id": "pua-012",
      "category": "pua",
      "text": "为了帮你争取机会，我顶了多大压力。",
      "tags": [
        "用户素材"
      ],
      "audience": "optional",
      "enabled_by_default": false
    },
    {
      "id": "pua-013",
      "category": "pua",
      "text": "大家都加班，你怎么好意思准点走？",
      "tags": [
        "用户素材"
      ],
      "audience": "optional",
      "enabled_by_default": false
    },
    {
      "id": "pua-014",
      "category": "pua",
      "text": "给你这个任务是因为我看重你，别人想干我还不给。",
      "tags": [
        "用户素材"
      ],
      "audience": "optional",
      "enabled_by_default": false
    },
    {
      "id": "pua-015",
      "category": "pua",
      "text": "你要有大局观，个人利益要服从集体利益。",
      "tags": [
        "用户素材"
      ],
      "audience": "optional",
      "enabled_by_default": false
    },
    {
      "id": "pua-016",
      "category": "pua",
      "text": "外面经济形势这么差，出去就是失业。",
      "tags": [
        "用户素材"
      ],
      "audience": "optional",
      "enabled_by_default": false
    },
    {
      "id": "pua-017",
      "category": "pua",
      "text": "你不干，后面排着长队的人等着干。",
      "tags": [
        "用户素材"
      ],
      "audience": "optional",
      "enabled_by_default": false
    },
    {
      "id": "pua-018",
      "category": "pua",
      "text": "你这点抗压能力，到哪都混不下去。",
      "tags": [
        "用户素材"
      ],
      "audience": "optional",
      "enabled_by_default": false
    },
    {
      "id": "pua-019",
      "category": "pua",
      "text": "你年龄也不小了，跳槽还有竞争力吗？",
      "tags": [
        "用户素材"
      ],
      "audience": "optional",
      "enabled_by_default": false
    },
    {
      "id": "blame-001",
      "category": "blame",
      "text": "这件事交给你，我比较放心。",
      "tags": [
        "用户素材"
      ],
      "audience": "optional",
      "enabled_by_default": false
    },
    {
      "id": "blame-002",
      "category": "blame",
      "text": "我相信你的能力。",
      "tags": [
        "用户素材"
      ],
      "audience": "optional",
      "enabled_by_default": false
    },
    {
      "id": "blame-003",
      "category": "blame",
      "text": "你办事我放心。",
      "tags": [
        "用户素材"
      ],
      "audience": "optional",
      "enabled_by_default": false
    },
    {
      "id": "blame-004",
      "category": "blame",
      "text": "这是对你的考验。",
      "tags": [
        "用户素材"
      ],
      "audience": "optional",
      "enabled_by_default": false
    },
    {
      "id": "blame-005",
      "category": "blame",
      "text": "这么重要的事，你不知道提醒我？",
      "tags": [
        "用户素材"
      ],
      "audience": "optional",
      "enabled_by_default": false
    },
    {
      "id": "blame-006",
      "category": "blame",
      "text": "这个事我觉得……也不是不行。",
      "tags": [
        "用户素材"
      ],
      "audience": "optional",
      "enabled_by_default": false
    },
    {
      "id": "blame-007",
      "category": "blame",
      "text": "领导是这个意思，咱们照做就行。",
      "tags": [
        "用户素材"
      ],
      "audience": "optional",
      "enabled_by_default": false
    },
    {
      "id": "nonsense-001",
      "category": "nonsense",
      "text": "上班的时候，人大多是在上班。",
      "tags": [
        "用户素材"
      ],
      "audience": "general",
      "enabled_by_default": true
    },
    {
      "id": "nonsense-002",
      "category": "nonsense",
      "text": "任务越多，要做的工作也就越多。",
      "tags": [
        "用户素材"
      ],
      "audience": "general",
      "enabled_by_default": true
    },
    {
      "id": "nonsense-003",
      "category": "nonsense",
      "text": "领导说辛苦了，我说不辛苦。至于苦不苦，我说了你也不知道。",
      "tags": [
        "用户素材"
      ],
      "audience": "general",
      "enabled_by_default": true
    },
    {
      "id": "nonsense-004",
      "category": "nonsense",
      "text": "每次开完会我都觉得收获满满，仔细一想，满满的全是会议。",
      "tags": [
        "用户素材"
      ],
      "audience": "general",
      "enabled_by_default": true
    },
    {
      "id": "nonsense-005",
      "category": "nonsense",
      "text": "领导说的都对，不对的时候请参考上一条。",
      "tags": [
        "用户素材"
      ],
      "audience": "general",
      "enabled_by_default": true
    },
    {
      "id": "nonsense-006",
      "category": "nonsense",
      "text": "我的职业规划就是：先有份工作。",
      "tags": [
        "用户素材"
      ],
      "audience": "general",
      "enabled_by_default": true
    },
    {
      "id": "nonsense-007",
      "category": "nonsense",
      "text": "关于年终奖，我只能说：有总比没有好。没有的话……那就没有。",
      "tags": [
        "用户素材"
      ],
      "audience": "general",
      "enabled_by_default": true
    },
    {
      "id": "sarcasm-001",
      "category": "sarcasm",
      "text": "你挺有想法的啊。",
      "tags": [
        "用户素材"
      ],
      "audience": "optional",
      "enabled_by_default": false
    },
    {
      "id": "sarcasm-002",
      "category": "sarcasm",
      "text": "我这个人说话直。",
      "tags": [
        "用户素材"
      ],
      "audience": "optional",
      "enabled_by_default": false
    },
    {
      "id": "sarcasm-003",
      "category": "sarcasm",
      "text": "年轻人要有格局。",
      "tags": [
        "用户素材"
      ],
      "audience": "optional",
      "enabled_by_default": false
    },
    {
      "id": "sarcasm-004",
      "category": "sarcasm",
      "text": "这个方案再优化下。",
      "tags": [
        "用户素材"
      ],
      "audience": "optional",
      "enabled_by_default": false
    },
    {
      "id": "sarcasm-005",
      "category": "sarcasm",
      "text": "这事你看着办吧。",
      "tags": [
        "用户素材"
      ],
      "audience": "optional",
      "enabled_by_default": false
    },
    {
      "id": "sarcasm-006",
      "category": "sarcasm",
      "text": "你最近是不是谈恋爱了？",
      "tags": [
        "用户素材"
      ],
      "audience": "optional",
      "enabled_by_default": false
    },
    {
      "id": "sarcasm-007",
      "category": "sarcasm",
      "text": "你最近怎么样？",
      "tags": [
        "用户素材"
      ],
      "audience": "optional",
      "enabled_by_default": false
    }
  ]
}
